
       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. INTCALC.

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

       01  WS-ACCOUNT-COUNT PIC 9(3) VALUE 0.
       01  WS-COUNTER       PIC 9(3) VALUE 0.

       01  WS-BALANCE       PIC 9(9)V99 VALUE 0.
       01  WS-ANNUAL-RATE   PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE 0.

       01  WS-INTEREST      PIC 9(9)V99 VALUE 0.
       01  WS-TOTAL-INTEREST PIC 9(11)V99 VALUE 0.

       01  WS-DISPLAY-BALANCE PIC Z,ZZZ,ZZ9.99.
       01  WS-DISPLAY-RATE    PIC ZZ9.99.
       01  WS-DISPLAY-INTEREST PIC Z,ZZZ,ZZ9.99.
       01  WS-DISPLAY-TOTAL   PIC Z,ZZZ,ZZZ,ZZ9.99.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.

       MAIN-PROCEDURE.

           DISPLAY "ENTER NUMBER OF ACCOUNTS:"
           ACCEPT WS-ACCOUNT-COUNT

           PERFORM VARYING WS-COUNTER FROM 1 BY 1
               UNTIL WS-COUNTER > WS-ACCOUNT-COUNT

               DISPLAY "ENTER BALANCE:"
               ACCEPT WS-BALANCE

               DISPLAY "ENTER ANNUAL RATE:"
               ACCEPT WS-ANNUAL-RATE

               COMPUTE WS-INTEREST ROUNDED =
                   WS-BALANCE * WS-ANNUAL-RATE / 1200

               ADD WS-INTEREST TO WS-TOTAL-INTEREST

               MOVE WS-BALANCE TO WS-DISPLAY-BALANCE
               MOVE WS-ANNUAL-RATE TO WS-DISPLAY-RATE
               MOVE WS-INTEREST TO WS-DISPLAY-INTEREST

               DISPLAY "ACCOUNT " WS-COUNTER
               DISPLAY "BALANCE: " WS-DISPLAY-BALANCE
               DISPLAY "ANNUAL RATE: " WS-DISPLAY-RATE "%"
               DISPLAY "MONTHLY INTEREST: "
                   WS-DISPLAY-INTEREST

           END-PERFORM

           MOVE WS-TOTAL-INTEREST TO WS-DISPLAY-TOTAL

           DISPLAY "TOTAL MONTHLY INTEREST: "
               WS-DISPLAY-TOTAL

           STOP RUN.

